    "original_requirement": "设计一个智能蜂鸣提示系统，使用 HC-SR04（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）、蜂鸣器 D6、按钮 D2 和 LED D13。系统默认根据距离远近调整蜂鸣器提示频率；按钮用于静音/取消静音，静音时 LED 常亮作为提示，但串口仍输出距离信息。",
    "effective_requirement": "设计一个智能蜂鸣提示系统，使用 HC-SR04（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）、蜂鸣器 D6、按钮 D2 和 LED D13。系统默认根据距离远近调整蜂鸣器提示频率；按钮用于静音/取消静音，静音时 LED 常亮作为提示，但串口仍输出距离信息。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v1\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"ultrasonic\", \"trigger_pin\": \"D8\", \"echo_pin\": \"D9\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
